# ============================================================
# Git 属性：换行归一化 + Git LFS 跟踪规则
# 需要先执行一次 `git lfs install`（本机 git-lfs 3.7.1 已就绪）。
# 规则：可读的 YAML/代码走文本（保留 diff 与合并能力），
#       不可读的二进制美术资源走 LFS。
# ============================================================

* text=auto

# ---------- 必须保持文本：Unity YAML / C# / 配置 ----------
# 场景与预制体是 YAML 文本，走 LFS 会让代码审查完全无法看 diff。
*.cs               text diff=csharp
*.shader           text
*.hlsl             text
*.cginc            text
*.compute          text
*.asmdef           text
*.asmref           text
*.unity            text
*.prefab           text
*.asset            text
*.mat              text
*.meta             text
*.anim             text
*.controller       text
*.mask             text
*.playable         text
*.physicMaterial   text
*.physicMaterial2D text
*.guiskin          text
*.fontsettings     text
*.unitypackage.meta text
*.json             text
*.xml              text
*.yaml             text
*.yml              text
*.md               text
*.txt              text
*.editorconfig     text
*.gitignore        text
*.gitattributes    text
Manifest.json      text
packages-lock.json text

